# Never copy installed deps or build output into the image context — the image
# installs and builds from a clean state. Keeps the build context small and
# avoids leaking host-specific artifacts.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/.git
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.log

# Other apps/artifacts that have no place in the worker image (Playwright must
# never be bundled alongside the Vercel web app).
apps/web

# Local/editor noise
.DS_Store
**/.vscode
**/.idea
scratchpad
